model halina
  tally 2
  on 2026-09-30
  start 2024-01-01
  end 2064-12-31
  note "Household D of the case set (Halina Sowa, widowed 2024-05-17), in tally 2. Facts from the dossier tmp/cases/D: story.md, house-rules.md and docs/D-Dnn.md, each version citing its document and known on the day the document reached Halina (the received date in its header)."
  note "Bank Olcha's exports (records/olcha-*.csv) are not imported: tally 2 names no import for their dialect (observation O:D-1). records.tally writes as observations only the rows a question reads, each citing its file and line, and the balances the questions read as stated readings that anchor the account; no version says covers."
  note "Law figures a household def needs and no law part states as a row (a half, a month of the year, a return's day) are rows here, citing the act's own source and point."

